@baseUrl = http://0.0.0.0:8080/api/v1
@token = 12345678

### ============================================================
### 波动率与量化计算接口
### ============================================================

### 计算 Yang-Zhang 已实现波动率
POST {{baseUrl}}/ak/cal/volatility_yz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "date": "2024-01-01", "open": 10.0, "high": 10.5, "low": 9.8, "close": 10.2 },
  { "date": "2024-01-02", "open": 10.3, "high": 10.8, "low": 10.1, "close": 10.6 },
  { "date": "2024-01-03", "open": 10.5, "high": 10.9, "low": 10.2, "close": 10.4 }
]

### 股票分钟行情清洗 (东方财富 - 000001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/cal/rv_stock_em?symbol=000001&period=5&adjust=hfq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 期货分钟行情清洗 (新浪 - IF2008)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ak/cal/rv_futures_sina?symbol=IF2008&period=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
